# The agent-index usage client, pinned.
#
# Not committed: plow-pbc/agent-index-client owns that file and is public, so
# this repo names a commit instead of carrying a copy that drifts from it.
# The image build fetches exactly this revision and refuses anything else.
#
# A sha, never `main`. This runs inside an agent holding a live Plow
# credential, so a moving reference would substitute unreviewed code under
# it. The checksum is the second half: a sha in a URL is only as good as the
# host serving it. Both verified locally against the live repo before this
# file was written.
sha=87901f8b182a8a7c65ee3dd7267f8f835ee2a545
sha256=c3bf54ed37aec22704b8003a7ff6385a1fd3ef49207ce55613ddc41df36a1b01
